Package: parlayapiR
Title: Client for the 'ParlayAPI' Sports Odds API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jacob", "Galperin", , "jgalperi@ramapo.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Query real-time and historical sports betting odds from the
    'ParlayAPI' service <https://parlay-api.com>, which aggregates odds
    from more than 30 sportsbook sources. Coverage and historical
    availability depend on the sport, source, market, date and account.
    Provides functions for listing sports, fetching game odds and player
    props, retrieving historical and closing lines, removing the
    bookmaker margin from quoted prices ('devigging') by the
    multiplicative, additive, or power method, and sizing bets with the
    Kelly criterion. A sandbox mode runs every example against keyless
    synthetic endpoints, so the package can be tried without an API key.
